---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTABand from '../../components/CTABand.astro';
---
<Base
  title="For institutions | Salet"
  description="Salet works privately with institutional clients on deal sourcing, screening and analysis, and transaction advisory, under contract and under their frameworks."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Service 06 · By engagement"
    title="Institutional sourcing and transaction advisory"
    lede="Alongside its private-client concierge, Salet works with a small number of institutional clients on sourcing, screening and analysis. This work is delivered privately, under contract, and is not offered to the public."
    compact
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="prose-salet lg:col-span-7">
        <h2>What the practice covers</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Deal sourcing and screening.</strong> Structured search against an institutional brief, with disciplined filtering so decision-makers see genuine candidates only.</li>
          <li><strong>Analysis and packaging.</strong> Full workups: comparables, condition and title flags, refurbishment context, yield and exit scenarios, presented decision-ready.</li>
          <li><strong>Viewings and local verification.</strong> Boots on the ground across the West Midlands and beyond.</li>
          <li><strong>Transaction advisory.</strong> Support through negotiation and progression on request.</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>How it is engaged</h2>
        <p>
          Institutional work runs under each client's own agreement, framework and approvals. Salet does not market
          properties or investment opportunities to the public, and client mandates are never named or discussed
          publicly. If your organisation acquires UK residential property and wants disciplined sourcing capacity,
          write to us directly.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="mailto:saran@salet.uk">saran@salet.uk</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="reveal border border-line bg-ivory-2/60 p-8 lg:p-10">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-green-2">Working principles</p>
          <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone">
            <li>Private delivery under contract, inside the client's compliance framework</li>
            <li>Client confidentiality as standard; mandates are never named publicly</li>
            <li>Analysis standards identical to the private-client practice</li>
            <li>No public deal marketing of any kind</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABand title="Discuss an institutional mandate" body="A direct conversation with the founder about your acquisition criteria and how Salet's sourcing discipline can serve them." />
</Base>
